WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
Chun-Li approaches the corner with raw Drive Rush.

2
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.400
Down-forward heavy punch connects late on Juri.

3
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.050
Back heavy punch links after the late Rush overhead.

4
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:03.650
Heavy Hundred Lightning Kicks juggles Juri beside the wall.

5
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:05.750
Heavy Tensho Kicks continues the corner juggle.

6
00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:06.200
Juri recovers beside the wall after the juggle.
